        "accession_number": "0000858877-25-000111",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The industry in which we compete is subject to rapid technological developments, evolving standards, changes in customer requirements, and new product introductions and enhancements.",
        "start_character": 30531,
        "end_character": 30713
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000858877-25-000111",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000858877-25-000111-c63d07c5ceca03b9",
        "accession_number": "0000858877-25-000111",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The principal competitive factors in the markets in which we presently compete and may compete in the future include the ability to sell successful business outcomes;",
        "start_character": 28774,
        "end_character": 28940
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000858877-25-000111",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000858877-25-000111-c63d07c5ceca03b9",
        "accession_number": "0000858877-25-000111",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To help deliver on them, we are bringing together the power of our portfolio, which we refer to as One Cisco, which provides three key outcomes to our customers: i) AI-ready data centers, ii) future-proofed workplaces, and iii) digital resilience.",
        "start_character": 5141,
        "end_character": 5388
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000858877-25-000111",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000858877-25-000111-c63d07c5ceca03b9",
        "accession_number": "0000858877-25-000111",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We allocate our research and development budget among our product categories, which consist of Networking, Security, Collaboration, and Observability technologies.",
        "start_character": 30137,
        "end_character": 30300
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000858877-25-000111",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000858877-25-000111-c63d07c5ceca03b9",
        "accession_number": "0000858877-25-000111",
        "filing_date": "2025-09-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also include media, broadcast, and content providers within this customer market, as the lines in the telecommunications industry continue to blur between traditional network-based, content-based and application-based services.",
